<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz GDP rises 6.1 pct in Jan-Nov.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz GDP rises 6.1 pct in Jan-Nov.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's gross domestic product in the first 11 months of this year was 6.1 percent higher than in the same period a year earlier, the National Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p> KYRGYZ GDP		   Jan-Nov 96  Jan-Oct 96    Jan-Nov 95</p>
<p> year-on-year pct change    +6.1	  +7.3	    -6.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
